      "text": "The codebase is organized into Rust modules including main.rs (entry/routing), cli.rs, config.rs, provider.rs, gateway.rs, instructions.rs, api.rs, search.rs, server.rs, and tools.rs, plus instructions.txt, providers.toml, and docs/."
